BEGIN;

-- v4 Bible expansion, part 2: 45 further real-world places.
-- Coordinates identify present-day sites or conventional reference points.
-- Anything scholars dispute is is_inferred=true with coordinate_accuracy='inferred'
-- so the map can render uncertainty instead of implying a settled identification.

